{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-hook-weight-derivation","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Conjecture","doco:Section"],"label":"conj:hook-weight-derivation","kind":"conjecture","title":"Hook weight $\\beta_4 = -\\tfrac{1}{2} w_{[2,2]}(4)$ from baryon Wedderburn-Artin decomposition","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-degree-two-baryon-weight","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/conj-shell-transition-knot"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BaryonWeight.beta4_hook","text":"hook-weight-derivation.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"conj:hook-weight-derivation\"></a><p><strong>Conditional on <a href=\"#conj:shell-transition-knot\" data-at=\"knots-particles-confinement/borromean-reidemeister\">Stability pairs from Borromean spin-orbit shell-transition knots</a>.</strong>\n<em>The coefficient of the hook invariant <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Phi_4</code> in the\nfour-channel mass formula is</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\beta_4 = -\\tfrac{1}{2}\\, w_{[2,2]}(4)\n          = -\\frac{\\dim_q([2,2])^2}{2\\,[4]_q!}\n          \\approx -0.083</code></pre>\n<p><em>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">w_{[2,2]}(4) = \\dim_q([2,2])^2 / [4]_q!</code> is the\nWedderburn-Artin weight of the hook partition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[2,2]</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_4(R, q)</code>,\nthe baryon's internal Hecke algebra (3 quarks + gluon =\n4 strands).</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/hook-weight-derivation.md","heading":"Conjecture","number":"13.21.13","page":"b/conj-hook-weight-derivation","qa":{"counts":{"pass":92,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":77},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.EightfoldWay.beta4_hook","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/EightfoldWay/beta4_hook.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
